    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d204-a1">

                <pb facs="0292" n="212" sameAs="frus:frus1901/pg212"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Lord Lansdowne to Mr. Choate.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-02-14"><hi rendition="#italic">February 14,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Your Excellency</hi>: The prime minister duly laid
                    before the King the copy of the resolution of the Senate of the United States of
                    America which your excellency forwarded in your note to me of the 8th
                    instant.</p>
                <pb facs="0293" n="213" xml:id="pg213"/>
                <p>By command of the King, I am to request your excellency to be so kind as to
                    express to the President of the Senate His Majesty’s most sincere thanks for the
                    mark of respect shown by the Senate of the United States to the memory of her
                    deeply lamented Majesty Queen Victoria, Empress of India.</p>
                <p>The terms of the resolution are highly appreciated by His Majesty.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansdowne.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
